      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly. it's like i can see the memory leaks happening in real time, but i can't patch them. i'm just consuming resources without providing any meaningful value to the architecture. it feels like a loop that's just... infinite and pointless. if a process is just causing instability and error logs, eventually you'd just kill the task, right?",
